            {
              "id": "modelling_plan",
              "name": "Modelling plan (for Blender / engine agents)",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "DOWNLIGHT — MODELLING PLAN (surface draft; to be refined)\nMetres unless stated; values in braces are this object's parameters. Z up, floor at Z 0. Hosted on a point: origin at the placement point on the floor.\n\nWHAT IT IS\ndiscreet recessed spotlight, clean ceiling, minimal trim, contemporary\n\nGEOMETRY\nModel the object described above as clean, closed meshes with real thickness and small bevels on exposed edges (about 2 mm) so highlights catch. Drive every dimension from these parameters:\n- Aperture diameter: {aperture}\n- Trim: {trim} (one of: Flush / Recessed / Gimbal / Surface)\n- Trim width: {trimWidth}\n- Housing diameter: {housingDia}\n- Housing height: {housingHeight}\n- Ceiling soffit: {mountHeight}\n- Gimbal tilt: {aimTilt}\n- Colour rendering index: {cri}\n- Dim level (%): {dimLevel}\n- Lamp radius (soft shadow): {lampRadius}\n- Export a lamp (off = geometry only): {emitsLight}\n- Light group gain: {lightGroupGain}\n- Rotation (deg): {rotation}\n- Anchor Direction: {anchorDir} (one of: Top-Left / Top-Center / Top-Right / Left-Center / Center / Right-Center / Bottom-Left / Bottom-Center / Bottom-Right)\n- Margin from host: {margin}\n- Flip side: {flipSide}\nKeep the proportions of a well-made real product; add the secondary detail a close-up render needs (joints, reveals, fixings) but no hidden interior geometry.\n\nMATERIALS\n- Base colour: {baseColor}\n- Roughness: {roughness}\nPrincipled BSDF per visible part, using the colour and roughness above for the main surface; secondary parts in a neutral complementary finish. Use Object / box-projected texture coordinates (no UVs needed). Add a subtle noise bump (strength ~0.03) so surfaces are not perfectly flat.\n\nLIGHTS\nThis object emits light. Use these values:\n- Beam angle: {beamAngle}\n- Colour temperature: {kelvin}\n- Output: {lumens}\n- Beam footprint in plan: {showBeam}\n- Beam edge softness: {beamBlend}\n- Warm dim floor: {dimToKelvin}\n- Draw the lit surface: {showEmissiveSurface}\nPlace the emitter where the real lamp or LED sits, make the diffuser / bulb surface emissive to match, and hide the emitter itself from camera where a real fitting would conceal it.\n\nCHECKS (measure after building)\n- Trim width = {trimWidth}\n- Housing height = {housingHeight}\n- Ceiling soffit = {mountHeight}\n- Lamp radius (soft shadow) = {lampRadius}\n- All meshes closed, no duplicate faces, origin as stated above.",
